// `segment_mib` (32 MiB default, 512 max) and never grown: a level-0
// whole-volume segmentation of a large dataset does not fit the default,
// so a label volume is bbox-tight, or the manifest declares the arena it
// needs.  There is no representation for a coarser lattice -- `scale_zyx`
// is exactly what the definition rejects (`OverlayTransform`).
//
