//
// Converting to included pixel CENTERS is ceil(lo) ..= floor(hi), INCLUSIVE at
// both ends: an exactly-integral bound is a hit.  Because a crop set on pixel
// boundaries always lands on .5, that conversion carries ~0.5 of margin against
// rounding and float error instead of sitting on a tie.
//
