// The SAMPLING FACTOR from level 0 to this level, per axis -- what the
// downsampler DID, never the ratio of the two array shapes.  The two part on an
// odd dimension: vizi block-downsamples by 2 and discards an odd trailing
// sample, so 31 -> 15 is a scale of 2 and the shape ratio is 2.0667.
//
// It matters because control_plane_protocol.md §8.11's level map is
// `(e + 0.5)/scale - 0.5` applied directly to this number, so a ratio here puts
